WEBVTT

00:01:58.996 --> 00:02:01.996
and then he's wiping the needle on his shirt,

00:02:01.996 --> 00:02:03.996
and he injects the next guy.

00:02:03.996 --> 00:02:07.996
And Frankie says, "I'm number 22 in line,

00:02:07.996 --> 00:02:10.996
and I can see the needle coming down towards me,

00:02:10.996 --> 00:02:12.996
and there is blood all over the place.

00:02:12.996 --> 00:02:14.996
It's getting blunter and blunter.

00:02:14.996 --> 00:02:17.996
And a small part of my brain is thinking,

00:02:17.996 --> 00:02:19.996
'That is so gross

00:02:19.996 --> 00:02:21.996
and really dangerous,'

00:02:21.996 --> 00:02:23.996
but most of my brain is thinking,

00:02:23.996 --> 00:02:25.996
'Please let there be some smack left

00:02:25.996 --> 00:02:27.996
by the time it gets to me.

00:02:27.996 --> 00:02:29.996
Please let there be some left.'"

00:02:29.996 --> 00:02:31.996
And then, telling me this story,